@startuml ai_report_flow
' Odoo 20 - the life of an AI report (ai.report):
' report_run / report_save / report_get are tools of the AI Assistant app
' (ai.assistant.tools); action_refresh, _share_with and the xlsx export
' (report.ai_assistant.ai_report_xlsx) run without the model.
' Preview: Alt+D (PlantUML extension)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica

title An AI report: built by the model, computed by Odoo

actor Employee as owner
participant "Claude" as model
participant "AI Assistant tools\n(as the owner)" as tools
database "ai.report" as report
participant "App frame\n(sandboxed, CSP)" as frame
actor Colleague as colleague

owner -> model : asks for a report in the app
model -> tools : report_run(spec)
tools -> tools : datasets through read_group / search_read,\nformulas, merges; deny list applies
tools --> model : all the data, or "aggregate further"\n(past report_max_tokens or max_rows)
model -> tools : report_save(title, spec, page, bindings)
tools -> tools : page cleaned (no script, no href,\nno CSS loader); bindings checked;\nspec run again
tools -> report : spec, data, page, bindings,\ncompanies, data date
tools --> model : saved; the answer shows its card

owner -> frame : opens the report
report -> frame : page + data + Chart.js + renderer,\nonly the two scripts allowed by hash,\nnotes in the reader's language
frame -> frame : renderer fills figures, tables, charts;\n(partial) where a limit left rows out

== Revise ==
owner -> model : asks for a change in the conversation
model -> tools : report_get(report id)
tools --> model : title, page, bindings as untrusted data;\nthe spec for the owner or an administrator only
model -> tools : report_save(...): a new report

== Refresh (owner only, no model) ==
owner -> report : Refresh
report -> tools : spec run again as the owner, in the\nreport's companies they still work in
tools -> report : new data and data date;\npage and conclusions unchanged
note right of report
  A failure says why as the tools tell the
  model: their own texts as written, Odoo's
  errors by kind only, a model no longer
  installed in plain words. The data stays.
end note

== Share ==
owner -> report : Share with colleagues\n(share log keeps the report's title)
colleague -> frame : sees the owner's snapshot: title, owner,\ndates, page and data; may export it to xlsx
note right of colleague
  Its source conversation, recipients,
  spec and companies: administrators only.
end note
@enduml
